# LLM-assisted development (essentials)

**Read order:** [docs/AGENTS.md](../../docs/AGENTS.md) → this file (always on) → **changing-pulp-upload** + [docs/CLAUDE.md](../../docs/CLAUDE.md) for `upload`/Tekton consumers → **changing-pulp-container** for `container/Dockerfile`/`.tekton/` image build → [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](../../docs/ARCHITECTURE.md) when touching multiple packages. **On-demand skills:** [.cursor/rules/llm-development-guidelines-deep.mdc](llm-development-guidelines-deep.mdc) (skill index).

