## Checklist (same as CI)

- Pre-commit commit stage: fully passing run (not “mostly” fixed).
- Pre-commit pre-push stage (`make test-diff-coverage`, checkton) after `git fetch origin`.
- Tests: full `make test` green.
- PR materials: only after user confirmation; use **drafting-pulp-tool-pr** skill.
